---
title: "SSD: Declare Weekly Availability (UC-01)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant System as :System
    Employee->>System: declare(effectiveFrom, slots)
    alt a time is bad, two windows on one day, or the date is in the past
        System-->>Employee: error, nothing saved
    else
        System-->>Employee: saved
    end
    Note over Employee,System: from effectiveFrom on, R1 checks<br/>shifts against the new availability
